Read the settings files scripts ask for out of archives, and the player's copies first

Mods ship folders of their mods folder packed (mods\Foo.dat\foo.ini): sfall's ini calls now read such a file out of the archive on its path. The page's copies of settings files, under overseer\settings, are read in place of the game's, and a script's change to a file in an archive goes into such a copy. Scripts asking ddraw.ini whether unsafe scripting is on are told it is: the engine answers for the memory it knows whatever it says.
